### Location update
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/locations/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": "driver-1",
  "cityId": "warsaw",
  "lat": 52.2297,
  "lng": 21.0122,
  "heading": 90,
  "speed": 35,
  "accuracyMeters": 6
}

### Nearby drivers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/locations/nearby-drivers?cityId=warsaw&lat=52.2297&lng=21.0122&ringSize=2&limit=10

### Pricing estimate
POST http://localhost:8083/api/v1/pricing/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityId": "warsaw",
  "vehicleType": "standard",
  "distanceKm": 8.4,
  "durationMinutes": 22,
  "activeRequests": 120,
  "availableDrivers": 80
}

### Fraud assessment
POST http://localhost:8084/api/v1/fraud/assess
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectId": "passenger-1",
  "subjectType": "PASSENGER",
  "cityId": "warsaw",
  "cancellationCountLast24h": 1,
  "paymentFailuresLast7d": 0,
  "accountsOnDevice": 1,
  "maxGpsJumpKmLast10m": 0.2,
  "promoApplied": true
}

### Core API shard diagnostics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scaling/shard?cityId=warsaw

### Realtime node diagnostics
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/realtime/node

### Warehouse topic counts
GET http://localhost:8085/api/v1/warehouse/events/count-by-topic
